# 2026-11-03 D-449 round 2, slot 3 of 3: Galaxy S26 LiteRT-LM GPU rows of the weekly set
# (matrices/dashboard-text-v1-android-a.cells / -b1.cells) on the side build v0.19.0-pregpu: LiteRT-LM v0.19.0
# (771b06e1, the Android pin's commit) with Google's prebuilt GPU accelerator (the tag's
# prebuilt/android_arm64/libLiteRtGpuAccelerator.so, loaded at run time; android/engine-pins.json litert-lm.v0.19.0-pregpu,
# engine_version v0.19.0) in /data/local/tmp/llmbench/engines/v0.19.0-pregpu/, reading each model through its own link
# there (run_cell.side_model_path: its GPU caches apart from the flat build's). The flat v0.19.0 build (its GPU
# accelerator built from source and linked in) is not touched. Same rows, files and options as the weekly cells plus
# engine-build=; page rows (the campaign name carries dashboard). First row = the Android session anchor (the payload's
# admission reads it). Long-context cells first; Qwen3-0.6B short-chat in the last slot (every sitting's anchor phase
# runs that cell on the flat build, and the page shows a cell's newest session).
#   BENCH_SITTING=1 python3 scripts/dashboard_job.py s26 --cells matrices/d449-pregpu-s26-s3-android.cells --suffix d449pg-s3 --once --hold-held-by <keeper pid> --no-post --release-by <HH:MM>
